      "duration": 8320,
      "afterStroke": 64
    },
    {
      "text": "Lower focus confirms a continuous sole with a pale internal stripe and three hanging tread tips. I will keep those construction irregularities. Four quiet corner washes will reduce the bright frame so the upper boot light holds attention.",
