    },
    {
      "text": "The fuller yellow plane removes most of the toe seam\u2019s dark color; its raised bend remains. The pale sole turns stay subordinate. Three short warm neighbors and a cool ankle turn will break the shaft\u2019s uniform column before final lights.",
