      "text": "One boot waits for rain is finished at 80 animated marks. Broad overlaps closed the shaft gaps and connected the heel. A fuller yellow toe plane reduced the dark seam, though its relief remains. Warm front and cool side planes support a hollow cuff, pull tab, small wear marks and one compact upper reflection. The blue cloth carries a cool cast shadow and a hard left fold that became wider under attempted correction. I keep the angular cuff, raised joins, regular bristles, pale sole stripe and three tread tips. More covers would add relief faster than useful form.",
